### The numbers

- **19 workflows** in 6 categories, all written for my actual practice
- **305 dropdown options** across workflow variables — no free-text where a choice will do
- **9 prompt blocks × 6 options each** → **29.6 million** distinct block combinations, rather than a list of stored prompts
- **8 house rules**, 6 active by default
- **62 DOM bindings**, all verified to resolve

