4. **GRC Writing & Deliverables** — CISO one-page verdict memo, structured Jira comment, long-form report skeleton
5. **Skill & Agent Engineering** — productise a repeated task, write a triggering description, red-team your own skill
6. **EB-1A & Career Positioning** — criterion evidence mapper, letter claim-to-exhibit map, publication angle finder

